<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Drifting VOID: third-party notices</title>
<style>
  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 860px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 16px; color: #222; background: #fff; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; } h2 { font-size: 17px; margin-top: 32px; }
  ul.crates { columns: 2; padding-left: 18px; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #ddd; background: #18171f; } pre { background: #24232c; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Drifting VOID: third-party notices</h1>
<p>Drifting VOID is free software under the GNU GPL version 3 or later, with
additional terms (see LICENSE and NOTICE; original repository
<a href="https://github.com/seven-ash/DriftingVOID">github.com/seven-ash/DriftingVOID</a>).
It is built with the components below, each under its own licence.</p>

<h2>Fonts</h2>
<p><b>Pretendard JP</b> (Regular, SemiBold), copyright 2021 Kil Hyung-jin
(<a href="https://github.com/orioncactus/pretendard">orioncactus/pretendard</a>), with Reserved Font
Name Pretendard JP; SIL Open Font License 1.1. Shipped in the
<code>fonts</code> folder with its licence, <code>OFL-PretendardJP.txt</code>.</p>
<p>The fonts built into egui (<code>epaint_default_fonts</code>) are listed with
their licences below.</p>

<h2>FFmpeg</h2>
<p>FFmpeg is not part of Drifting VOID. The setup can download a GPL build of it
(<a href="https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds">BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds</a>), which runs
as a separate program; its licence and sources are in the <code>ffmpeg</code>
folder of the installation.</p>

<h2>Rust crates</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3>{{name}}</h3>
<ul class="crates">
{{#each used_by}}<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
